@EXE_NAME@
=====================

HOW TO USE
----------
1. Start the game (TaskBarHero).
2. Once the game is running, double-click the launch script for your operating system:

   - WINDOWS: Double click `launch.bat` or directly run as administrator the @EXE_NAME@.exe
     (It asks Administrator privileges to read the game's memory).
   - LINUX: Run `./launch_linux.sh` (Requires `protontricks` to be installed on your system).

3. The GUI will pop up on your screen. You can use it to enable God Mode, Speedhacks, Rune Unlocks, and more!

TROUBLESHOOTING
---------------
- The tool isn't opening?
  Make sure you extracted the ENTIRE .zip file into a normal folder first. Do not try to run the launch scripts from inside the Windows zip viewer.

- Getting an error on Linux?
  Ensure `protontricks` is installed via your package manager or flatpak.

Found a bug or need help?
Visit: https://github.com/RiiK26/TaskBarHero-Cheetos/issues
